# Files that are part of the repository but not the website. Without this
# list Vercel served every file, including the calculator's source and
# prompts (supabase/), the research scripts, the project rules and the
# handbook's working files (found 2026-09-25).
/supabase
/scripts
/handbook_project
/.claude
/.github
/.sync
/digests
/digest-articles
/CLAUDE.md
/OVERNIGHT_LOG.md
/re-litigation-digest-*.md
# The backtest and the prediction registry stay public on purpose: the
# calibration page invites readers to check them. Everything else in the
# valuation project folder is working material.
/case_valuation_project/*
!/case_valuation_project/backtest
!/case_valuation_project/registry
